![Jumpitt](cover.jpg)

The _Jumpitt_ app was a prototype created in **May 2013** to apply
for entrepreneurship funds together with a group of people.

My job was to build a prototype using Objective-C.

The app consisted of a shopping cart that let you
buy products at fast food chains like _Fritz_.

The goal was to _"Skip the Line"_ and only go pick up
the order once it was ready.

For this the app used _Push Notifications_ and other
tools to tell the person they could go pick up their order.

Unfortunately the funds were not won and the app
was forgotten. Eventually the app gave origin to the
company **Jumpitt Labs**.

The following are some screenshots of the app in its prototype form.

